{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_title", "source_sha256": "17c7492d92e59d472c323ffb2b5b11f4a2caca57e852860e8df5498944ecc503", "ja": "舞台袖にて　～とっておきのいろいろ～", "zh": "舞台侧边　～绝活倾囊而出～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d1a718f52c03001cc592c3c28576720eec0a8e0f998ef8c17cc18b5fc31f9f2a", "ja": "会場の歓声の大きさにやる気を高める桃子達\nだったが、そんな中で静かに寝息を立てる\n美希に驚愕。しかし朋花が何か耳打ちする\nことで美希は即座に目を覚まし、\n一同は無事ステージに向かう。", "zh": "欢声雷动的会场，让桃子等人干劲十足。\n此时她们看见美希默默在睡觉大感震惊。\n然而，就在朋花对她说了几句悄悄话后，\n美希立刻清醒过来，\n全员终于顺利登上舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_1000_031tom", "source_sha256": "b2b96d604c1f863b096d71aa391151b06eae34c151df835387d958ab88157ca8", "ja": "会場の子豚ちゃん達、とても盛り上がっていますね～♪\n聖母として君臨のしがいがあるというものです～。", "zh": "会场里的小猪们，还真是亢奋呢～♪\n值得圣母降临此地成为主宰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "b03b9563284ed961307b972532bc98c24bf9df538e5de3e3044b9c670a4a82a6", "ja": "まあ、当然だよね。桃子達が\nとっておきのパフォーマンスをしてるんだもん。", "zh": "哎呀，这也是理所当然的，\n桃子我们可是使出绝活在表演嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "ffbfccf2db412595ab9bc44715871e9e941e7a5b23618f03a466610b50e443d3", "ja": "ふふ、今こそ私の悩殺ポーズの出番ね♪　会場中を\nもっと沸かせちゃいましょう！　ね、美希ちゃん？", "zh": "呵呵，现在就该轮到我的迷人姿势出场♪\n来让会场更加沸腾吧！你说对不对，美希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "90735ee765c867eb376a8f76dec77a40ba72df1bb15f23764d577e3b61c35f5a", "ja": "むにゃむにゃ……すぅ……。", "zh": "呼……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "ce25e30cea21ffe29353161511d6e9444d5683b0e3d8e06a297c9b03dcb8c120", "ja": "って、あら？　もしかして寝ちゃってる？？\n美希ちゃーん！　そろそろ出番だから起きてー！", "zh": "咦，哎呀？你该不会是睡着了吧？\n美希～！差不多要轮到我们出场了，快醒醒──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "1f43de3ac908501200017ef8efefcc94fa1b41f796262a5d9c19b4452a941ad0", "ja": "うん、大丈夫……。\nそれじゃ、いってくるね……あふぅ。", "zh": "嗯，没问题……\n那我要上啰……啊呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "00156c31b8393440a08176419512552daf988871450d0f5720a2a9734946fe83", "ja": "待って待って！？\nまだ前の曲が終わってないから、出てっちゃダメよ！", "zh": "等、等一下！\n上一首歌还没结束，你还不能出去啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "7e0ce207e3f3859068213fc1c64da4ae338c96f67c8431d36184f45da517bb98", "ja": "もう、美希さんってば、\n本番前に寝ぼけてるなんてプロとして失格だよ。", "zh": "唉，美希姊真是的，竟然在正式登台前睡昏头，\n这样有失专业人士的素养喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "299f093ae26e2e06a315df15fe5e7c0266ae9da30e7d54839c7d9bb5045697c4", "ja": "仕方ありませんね～。\nここは私にまかせてください～。", "zh": "真拿她没办法～\n这边就交给我吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "6c64c5aa8f30c94d1bc4d9f5565209bfee0269284bb87de83b39ebc7e81d4677", "ja": "美希ちゃん、ちょっといいですか～？\nゴニョゴニョゴニョ……なので、お願いしますね～。", "zh": "小美希，可以听我说几句吗～？\n（窸窸窣窣）……所以，就拜托你了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "fbcac78463d157767bffb0ced69292ed428692d32ea6fa0c939d807eb571153c", "ja": "あはっ、準備OKってカンジ！\n思いっきり、盛り上げちゃおうね☆", "zh": "啊哈，准备OK了的感觉！\n去用全力炒热气氛吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "13ab5ca04c31012af9c24bb5fc4d395ff651346bbaa46e3b0738fe18ee876980", "ja": "すごい！　さっきまで寝てたのに……。\n朋花さん、なんて言ったの？", "zh": "好厉害！她刚才明明还在睡觉……\n朋花姊，你对她说了什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "8e76eb3bb67887561cb99b1ae70722e6241b5d55b44092b1329ade2d9d45051d", "ja": "ふふ、聖母に不可能はないんですよ～♪　おや～、\nどうやら前のステージが終わったみたいですね～。", "zh": "呵呵，对圣母来说没有什么是做不到的～♪\n哦～看来前一段表演正好结束了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "8f719e991ce7f48a0c6f1e562899eb9fecda738e66ab2808ff9af7d4c9aa1843", "ja": "やっと桃子達の出番だね。美希さんも起きてくれたし、\n他のみんなに負けないように盛り上げなきゃ！", "zh": "终于轮到桃子我们登场了呢。美希姊也醒来了，\n我们要卖力活跃气氛，不能输给其他人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_12_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "5249c49be33622a593292020756918718738abf7141de80b9dbba2822b3ba7ca", "ja": "{$P$}くんも期待しててね？\n私達から目を離しちゃダメよ♪", "zh": "{$P$}也要好好期待喔！\n不可以从我们身上移开视线唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
